This repository is infrastructure only: Kubernetes manifests, Helm values,
shell scripts, Kyverno policies, bats tests, and a small Python benchmark
harness. It builds and publishes no container image of its own, and it
vendors no third-party source code.

Every upstream component it installs is fetched at install time from that
project's own chart or image registry, under that project's own licence, and
is pinned in versions.yaml with the date the version was read. Nothing here
redistributes those components.

